From blend weight 0.9 (and the landing hook's preload, not awaited) one board lease is built under a hidden
holder: 24 instances per frame, board layer + camera off first, then components enabled 24 per frame. The board
entry adopts it (entry token owns it, her copy is taken on adopt); the rig stays active and the camera turns on
only when visible and the board host is shown (reveal). Lighting writes unchanged. Unadopted preload is
cancelled/disposed with the journey; no preload or a failed one -> the normal build. Test:
tools/lakeside/test_lakeside_board_preload.cjs (lakeside-board-preload).
